Surface: com/teslasync/feature-views/FeatureToggles
  - FeatureToggles.kt        (Compose render layer: stateful store-bound entry + stateless content + previews)
  - FeatureTogglesModel.kt   (pure projection + lucide Flag/Refresh glyphs + view.opened diagnostic)
Tests:
  - app/src/test/java/io/teslasync/android/featureviews/featuretoggles/FeatureTogglesProjectionTest.kt   (JVM unit)
  - app/src/androidTest/java/io/teslasync/android/featureviews/featuretoggles/FeatureTogglesUiTest.kt    (Compose UI + a11y)

Web source (THE spec): web/src/features/settings/components/FeatureToggles.tsx
Data binding: shared P1/S8 io.teslasync.shared.core.presentation.user.UserStore
  (teslaFeatureConfig() read + refreshTeslaFeatureConfig() mutation) — no HTTP in the view (ADR-002).
  Envelope = TeslaConfigEnvelope<JsonElement> { data, fetchedAt }, projected through toUiState (ADR-013).
Adapter (pure, 1:1 port of the web useMemo): a JSON-object `data` blob flattens to {key, enabled, details}
  rows — an object value takes `enabled` from value.enabled and joins its other members as
  `k: JSON.stringify(v)`; a primitive value takes `enabled = Boolean(value)` with null details. The
  enabled coercion reproduces JS `Boolean()` truthiness over the JSON value domain (the `isString` guard
  keeps the boolean false distinct from the string "false"). Insertion order preserved (no sort).
i18n (P1/S10): all 12 source keys already exist as generated resources
  (translation_featureConfig_{title,subtitle,lastSynced,refresh,feature,status,details,enabled,disabled,noData},
   translation_toast_{featureConfigRefreshed,featureConfigFailed}) — no catalog change required.
IconBox: web `color="purple"` has no 1:1 Material token, folds to IconBoxTone.Primary
  (the InfrastructureSection precedent) so light/dark/high-contrast all resolve.
Telemetry (P1/S11): recordFeatureTogglesOpened(logger) -> logger.info("view.opened", {surface=FeatureToggles}).
States rendered: loading skeleton / hard-error+retry / empty(noData) / content table(Feature·Status·Details)
  / stale+offline freshness chip + auto-refresh. Header + Refresh stay visible in every state.

